"Paste a GitHub or Hugging Face (AI model, dataset, or Space) URL and RepoCheck tells you <b>(1) whether it looks safe (signs of malware or impersonation), (2) how to use it, (3) what technology it needs, (4) how hard it is, (5) whether you can use it for work (license), and (6) whether it still works</b>. Setup commands are ready to copy.": "只需粘贴 GitHub 或 Hugging Face（AI 模型、数据集、Space）的 URL，就能自动判断：<b>① 是否看起来安全（恶意软件、冒充的迹象）② 如何使用 ③ 需要哪些技术 ④ 难度如何 ⑤ 能否用于工作（许可证）⑥ 现在是否还能运行</b>。安装命令也会以可直接复制的形式给出。",
