"<li>Download executables <b>only from that repository’s Releases</b> (not from search ads, video descriptions, or external links in the README)</li><li><b>Never open password-protected archives</b></li><li>Do not use “Run as administrator” or <code>sudo</code> unless you understand why it is needed</li><li>Try new tools <b>somewhere other than your own computer</b> first, such as Google Colab</li><li>Before entering an API key or password, find out what it will be used for</li>": "<li>執行檔<b>只從該儲存庫的 Releases 下載</b>（不要從搜尋廣告、影片說明欄或 README 中的外部連結下載）</li><li><b>絕對不要開啟有密碼的壓縮檔</b></li><li>不明白原因時，不要使用「以系統管理員身分執行」或 <code>sudo</code></li><li>新工具請先在 Google Colab 等<b>自己電腦以外的地方</b>試用</li><li>輸入 API 金鑰或密碼前，先弄清楚它的用途</li>",
