"GitHub & Hugging Face Check + Safety Scan": "GitHub 與 Hugging Face 診斷 + 安全檢查",
"Paste a GitHub or Hugging Face (AI model, dataset, or Space) URL and RepoCheck tells you <b>(1) whether it looks safe (signs of malware or impersonation), (2) how to use it, (3) what technology it needs, (4) how hard it is, (5) whether you can use it for work (license), and (6) whether it still works</b>. Setup commands are ready to copy.": "只要貼上 GitHub 或 Hugging Face（AI 模型、資料集、Space）的 URL，就能自動判斷：<b>① 看起來是否安全（惡意軟體、冒充的跡象）② 如何使用 ③ 需要哪些技術 ④ 難度如何 ⑤ 能否用於工作（授權條款）⑥ 現在是否還能運作</b>。安裝指令也會以可直接複製的形式提供。",
